      "content": "It is true that \"meaning\" is a human construct, a narrative we build to navigate existence. Even if meaning is self-assigned, the process of creating value through your actions is what gives life its texture and momentum. You don't need cosmic justification for the intrinsic value of striving, experiencing, and connecting with others today.",
      "source": "target",
